Firmly plant your steamsaws in the ground, using them to propel yourself very quickly ([+297%, +365%, +418%, +463%, +503% (TL1-5; STEAMPOWER 100)] movement speed).

Any foes on either side of your movement get wrecked by the saws, knocking them 3 tiles away from you.

Attacking or using any talent will break this effect.

When this effect is broken or cancelled the sudden change in motion deals [144%, 163%, 177%, 189%, 200% (TL1-5)] weapon damage to all foes around you. To do full damage you need to have moved at least 5 times, otherwise damage is lower (or null for no movement).

''The wheels of death! Amazing!''
